==English==
{{wikipedia|Specification (disambiguation)|mul=Specification (technical standard)}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|frm|specification}}, from {{der|en|ML.|-}} ''[[specificationem]]'' (accusative of ''[[specificatio]]'').

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-specification.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# An explicit set of [[requirement]]s to be satisfied by a [[material]], [[product]], or [[service]].
# An act of [[specify]]ing.

